# Private agent documentation.
#
# Deny-by-default: everything under docs/ is local unless explicitly un-ignored
# below. project-initializer and update-for-model write into docs/, and a future
# run adding a new file must not leak by omission -- so the allowlist is the
# only way in.
docs/*
!docs/adapters.md

# CLAUDE.md carries the @docs/ imports for a personal Claude Code setup and
# points at files that do not exist in a clone. AGENTS.md is the public,
# self-contained one.
CLAUDE.md
